{
  "info": {
    "name": "Paprika Merchant Simulator",
    "_postman_id": "paprika-merchant-simulator-v1",
    "description": "Collection lengkap untuk Paprika Backend Simulator.\n\n**Setup awal:**\n1. Set variable `base_url` ke `http://10.10.10.32:8080` (atau `http://localhost:8080`)\n2. Jalankan **[Auth] Claim Session** lalu copy `session_token` dari response ke variable `token`\n3. Semua request bertanda 🔒 membutuhkan Bearer token\n\n**Fixture credentials:**\n- Company code: `A4F28K19PQ7M3XR9LB42`\n- Mock token: `mock_session_token_30d`\n\n**Merchant IDs:**\n- Warung Kosan: `mch_01HX3R9WKQF4P2KJ7DZM`\n- Kantin Pagi: `mch_01HX3RAKPQ7M3F4P2KJ7E`\n- Gerobak Rica: `mch_01HX3RBGRF4P2KJ7DZQ9W`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://192.168.0.102:8080",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Ganti sesuai IP komputer yang menjalankan simulator"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "mock_session_token_30d",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Session token — diisi otomatis setelah Claim Session"
    },
    {
      "key": "merchant_id_wk",
      "value": "mch_01HX3R9WKQF4P2KJ7DZM",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Warung Kosan — CPM enabled"
    },
    {
      "key": "merchant_id_kp",
      "value": "mch_01HX3RAKPQ7M3F4P2KJ7E",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Kantin Pagi — CPM enabled"
    },
    {
      "key": "merchant_id_gr",
      "value": "mch_01HX3RBGRF4P2KJ7DZQ9W",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Gerobak Rica — CPM disabled"
    },
    {
      "key": "transaction_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Diisi otomatis setelah Create QRIS / Link / Scan CPM"
